            <p rend="center">
               <pb facs="HS00048772X_0239"/>
               <hi rend="pre-print">– <rs type="place" ref="#pmb201000">
                     <hi rend="capitals">Verona</hi> – <hi rend="capitals">L’ Arena</hi>
                  </rs>
               </hi>
            </p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <pb facs="HS00048772X_0240"/>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb44153">Verona</rs>
                  <space unit="chars" quantity="1"/>
                  <date>5/9 1927</date>
               </dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>Herzliche Grüße.</p>
            <p>Heute <rs type="place" ref="#pmb462">Venedig</rs>, <rs type="place" ref="#pmb247609">Lido Corno d’oro</rs>, wäre sehr erfreut Gutes von Ihnen zu hören. Auch an
                  <unclear>Ihren</unclear>
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1"/>
               <rs type="person" ref="#pmb24648" subtype="implied">Bruder</rs> beste Grüße</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>A.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
